      "starRating": 5,
      "reviewDate": "2 months ago",
      "localGuideInfo": "Local Guide · 3K reviews",
      "text": "Green Lake Park is a true gem in the heart of Kunming. The moment you step in, the hustle and bustle of the city fades away, replaced by the serene beauty of nature. The lotus pond is a sight to behold, especially when the flowers are in full bloom. Watching the swans glide gracefully across the water is incredibly calming. The park is spacious and well-maintained, perfect for a morning or evening walk. There are plenty of spots to sit and relax, and the snack shops offer a variety of drinks and",
      "scrapedAt": "2026-03-23T07:20:33.199Z"
    },
