      "text": "Another of China's gems. Such a beautiful park. Lots of things to suit the kids (bubble blowing bikes) boats to hire. Lots of interesting food and drink stalls. With others selling lovely jewellery etc. We went in November therefore we missed it in full bloom. But it did not detract from the charm of the place.",
